        aria-labelledby="tab-panel-168f33b4-beec-4316-ae55-4d42fc56a6a5"
>
    <div id="tabarea-168f33b4-beec-4316-ae55-4d42fc56a6a5" class="constrain">
<section class="py-4">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="generic-text">
            <p>The following are examples of maps that can be printed for public use:&nbsp;<br />
&nbsp;</p>

<ul>
	<li>Cities and Towns</li>
	<li>School Districts</li>
	<li>Voting Precincts</li>
	<li>Fire Districts</li>
	<li>Justice Precints</li>
	<li>Supervisorial Districts</li>
	<li>Zip Codes</li>
	<li>Technical Education Districts</li>
	<li>Legislative Districts</li>
	<li>Congressional Districts</li>
</ul>

<h5><br />
Pricing</h5>

<table border="1" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="width:500px">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td style="text-align:center">8.5&quot; x 11&quot; - $1</td>
			<td style="text-align:center">11&quot; x 17&quot; - $5</td>
			<td style="text-align:center">36&quot; x 48&quot; - $15</td>
			<td style="text-align:center">54&quot; x 70&quot; - $25</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>

<p>Many of these maps have already been created, but for those that have not or if you are interested in a custom map, the cost is $40/hour for labor plus the printing cost. If you are interested in ordering a paper map, please complete a <a href="/results-and-data/election-maps/election-map-request-form.html">map request form</a>.</p>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>    </div>
</div>
