<section id="electionMapsComponent" class="container-md py-4">
        <h1 class="centered text-center mb-1 text-blue">Adobe PDF Maps</h1>
        <hr class="underline centered mt-0"></hr>

        <div class="py-3">
            <p>Over 1,100 pre-formatted&nbsp;maps are available. Click the district type to list the maps available. Then select a map and it will open in a pop up. Once at the map, you can print it out or use Adobe Acrobat&#39;s tools to examine it.</p>

        </div>


