<section class="bg-blue">
    <div class="container container-md py-5 callout-section cactus-callout-left ">
        <div class="row px-3 callout-content content-left image-flex">
            <div class="col-md-7 px-0 pb-2 order-last">
                <h2 class="mb-1 text-white">Download Spatial Data</h2>
                <hr class="pt-0 mt-0 mb-4 hr-centered-mobile underline-border-blue small"/>
                <div class=" bg-blue-links">
                    <p>Geographic Information System mapping datasets are available for download. The Maricopa County Recorder&rsquo;s Office maintains these datasets which are refreshed weekly with any updates.</p>

                </div>
                    <p class="pt-5">
<a href="https://data-maricopa.opendata.arcgis.com/search?tags=Election" target="_blank" class="btn btn-alt btn-constrain-min">Download the Data</a>                    </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-5 d-flex align-items-end">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section><section class="py-4">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="generic-text">
            <p style="text-align:center"><em>For Arizona Legislative and Congressional district spatial data, please visit the Arizona Independent Redistricting Commission website:&nbsp;<a href="https://irc.az.gov/" target="_blank">https://irc.az.gov/</a>&nbsp;</em></p>

        </div>
    </div>
</section><section class="py-4">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="generic-text">
            <p>The Voting Precincts and Justice Precincts contained within these pages were approved by the Board of Supervisors on October 1, 2025, and effective as of January 2, 2026. The Board of Supervisor Districts contained within these pages were approved by the Board of Supervisors on June 30, 2022, and effective as of June 30, 2023. Information regarding the Legislative and Congressional Districts can be found here: <a href="https://irc.az.gov/" target="_blank">https://irc.az.gov/</a>&nbsp;</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Please note that these maps show districts and precincts within Maricopa County only. Some districts extend beyond Maricopa County, and only the parts within Maricopa County are shown here.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><em>Disclaimer: This website represents the best information available to Maricopa County Elections Department and the Recorder&rsquo;s Office, and every effort has been made to ensure all mapping data is current and accurate. The Maricopa County Elections Department and the Recorder&rsquo;s Office&nbsp;does not warrant its accuracy or completeness. These maps are not intended for surveying, engineering, or emergency response purposes. If you find any data you believe is inaccurate, or if you have any questions or comments on this web page, please send an email to <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#5b1e373e382f323435281c12081b363a293238342b3a753c342d"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="6d2801080e190402031e2a243e2d000c1f040e021d0c430a021b">[email&#160;protected]</span></a>.</em></p>

        </div>
    </div>
</section></main>
