            <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-xl-5 mb-4 ">
                <h3 class="px-3">Elections In Maricopa County</h3>
                <section class="py-4">
                    <div class="container constrain">
                        <div class="generic-text">
                            <p>
                                <p>Elections in Maricopa County are overseen by both the County Board of Supervisors and the County Recorder. The Board of Supervisors is responsible for candidate and campaign filings, Emergency and Election Day in-person voting, hiring of elections workers, and the processing and tabulation of ballots. The Recorder&#39;s Office is responsible for Early in-person voting, mail voting and voter registration.</p>

                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
